# the SMK-37's < and > (smk37.c): the bar shown on Steps, the scenes' half on Arrange, the page elsewhere;
# OCTAVE- / OCTAVE+ the keys' octave on every page; FADER BANK held alone shows its card without harm
wait 300
turn ALGO 1
wait 30
expect page Steps
tap RIGHT
wait 30
expect bar 2
tap RIGHT
wait 30
expect bar 3
tap LEFT
wait 30
expect bar 2
tap OCT+
wait 30
expect oct 1
expect bar 2
tap OCT-
wait 30
expect oct 0
tap HOME
wait 30
expect page Arrange
listen
tap RIGHT
wait 30
said SCENES
tap LEFT
wait 30
tap EDIT
wait 30
tap RIGHT
wait 30
press FBANK
wait 1200
release FBANK
wait 30
press KBANK
wait 1200
release KBANK
wait 30
shot buttons.png
